coach "Spy the QB"
about "A linebacker shadows the quarterback; everyone else plays it safe."

defense:
  when third down and to go over 8 -> call "Cover 3" or "Cover 1 Spy"
  otherwise -> call "Cover 1 Spy" or "Cover 3" or "Cover 1 Spy"

lineup:
  DL "Speed Rusher"
  LB "Coverage LB"
  CB "Shutdown Corner"
  S "Center Fielder"
